  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-c261b6037513b48a1e096872",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "当 ρ → 0（高代价控制）时，最优控制不移动除右半平面（RHP）以外的任何开环极点，而右半平面极点被移动至其在左半平面（LHP）的镜像位置。闭环极点为左半平面内对称根轨迹（SRL）上的起始点。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "When ρ → 0 (expensive control), the optimal control does not move any open-loop poles except those in the RHP, which are moved to their mirror images in the LHP. The closed-loop poles are the starting points on the SRL in the LHP.",
